WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 16 - Stage Storm

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:44.420
But do you really know how to assemble and maintain props?

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.420
Yes! And I'll work very hard for you!

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:54.260
We're putting on a fairytale play at a kindergarten next week.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.840
Could you give us a hand on that?

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:01.310
Yes, thank you!

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.630
It's good that you were able to find a part-time job.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:12.990
All thanks to you! I only got it because you introduced me to him!

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:16.460
I heard that the play you did at the Eishinza was well-received.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.500
Have you heard anything since?

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.780
Yeah. They told me they didn't need me anymore.

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:32.010
But Maya, how long are you going to live like this?

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:38.880
If you just join the Ondine Troupe, you'll get all your fees and tuition paid for,

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:42.590
you'll live in a dorm and you'll be able to focus on rehearsals without any distractions.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:44.260
But then...

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.680
I know what you're going to say,

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.750
but I worry about you.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.250
Sakurakouji...

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:52.870
You're always on my mind.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:55.030
Never forget that...

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.070
Maya.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:07.000
Thank you, Sakurakouji...

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.730
Thank you.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.270
Are you okay, Haru?

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:26.400
You can't keep coughing everywhere...

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.220
I'm so sorry!

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:42.490
What's happening to my body?

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.180
Maya!

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.190
What are you doing these days?

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.410
You don't even call...

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.830
For our next play, we've decided to put on a world-renowned masterpiece:

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:05.510
Wuthering Heights

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:04.110
Emily Brontë's <i>Wuthering Heights</i>.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:09.560
The sticking point is the female lead: wild and passionate Catherine.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:12.850
It'd be good to find a girl who can portray her perfectly...

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.210
I have someone in mind.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.040
Sir!

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:22.840
A little while back, I saw a very intriguing little girl acting over at the Eishinza.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:26.000
Do you mean Maya Kitajima?

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:29.680
Yes. I'd like to give her a try.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:35.620
If it works out, she may prove to be a very interesting actress.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.620
And have you decided on the Daito Theater's season opener?

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:43.650
Yes. This year, we have decided to start the season with William Gibson's...

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:46.210
<i>Miracle Worker</i>.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:49.240
We will make sure the casting is perfect.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:53.540
Helen Keller: she can't see, hear nor speak.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.220
Do you have any ideas who could play her?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:05:00.280
That's the problem. We've got a number of suitable candidates, but ultimately...

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:03.960
At this point in time, the best person for the role is Ayumi Himekawa.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:09.690
Ever since she starred in <i>The Prince and the Pauper</i>, she's improved tenfold.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:13.480
Her presence... her natural talent...

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:17.820
Yes, that's true. But it's a big world out there...

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.770
Do you know that there's an actress out there who even Ayumi Himekawa fears?

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.990
You're telling me that prodigy actually fears someone?

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:29.370
Well, we still have plenty of time to find the perfect Helen Keller.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:33.220
But, hold on a minute, sir... who exactly were you referring to?

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:37.970
A girl who doesn't look like she's capable of doing anything - a completely ordinary girl.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:39.840
At first glance, I mean.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:44.180
Is this where the moon should go?

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:48.180
Yes. An accident on the freeway?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:52.070
The traffic's not moving at all? So, you're going to be late then?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.990
Okay.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:57.040
Everyone... please can you be quiet now?!

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.890
I said, please be quiet!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:06.970
Until the play is ready to start, I'll tell you all a story.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:16.370
Once upon a time, in a land far far away, there lived a princess with pure white skin.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.180
They pulled my hair!

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.350
Don't cry.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:27.820
I'll tell you a story!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:33.330
Chigusa Tsukikage

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.270
Oh, Kikuko, what a surprise!

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:40.250
I haven't seen you in such a long time, Ms. Tsukikage.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.350
It's been years!

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:49.750
"Mirror mirror, on the wall:"

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:53.790
"who's the fairest of them all?"

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.020
"Tell me!"

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:02.130
"Who's the fairest of them all?"

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:08.260
"Snow White?!"

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:14.410
I wanted to thank you for offering my student,

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.620
Maya Kitajima, a role in your play.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.460
Maya Kitajima.

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:20.510
Such a frightening girl.

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:27.490
Even though she only had a bit part, all eyes were transfixed on her when she walked on stage.

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:31.390
The lead role... even the actors who usually bind performances together...

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:35.780
They were all caught up in her whirlwind; her radiance banished them to the shadows!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:41.240
She devastates any stage she steps on.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:46.720
I'm sorry, but the Eishinza will not employ her ever again.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.320
Just as I'd expect from you, Miss Harada.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.210
Ms. Tsukikage... that girl is destined for great things, isn't she?

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:59.510
She's destined to take the stage by storm!

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:05.420
You're correct, Miss Harada.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:09.190
She's a force to be reckoned with on the stage!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:12.820
While she's still young, I'm sure plenty of stages will be overwhelmed by her passion,

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:17.250
and no doubt, she'll be hounded out of lots of companies.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:18.670
But eventually, Miss Harada,

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:23.000
the world will have no choice but to recognize her.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:28.580
Then the masses will wish for a girl like that, more than anything.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:32.100
I know that day will eventually come.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.780
Ma'am...

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.620
Right, everyone!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.760
The performers have arrived!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.780
We're going to have to stop the story there for today...

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:53.530
But we wanted to hear the rest of it.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:09:07.050
Story! Story! Story!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:10.260
Silence!

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:13.700
Could you possibly wait until she finishes <i>Snow White</i>?

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:16.350
It doesn't look like we have much choice.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.720
I'm terribly sorry...

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:22.770
Okay, everyone, it looks like she'll be able to finish <i>Snow White</i> after all!

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:31.320
Please, hurry!

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.460
Okay!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.380
So, next...

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.300
Here's today's pay...

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.340
Thank you very much!

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:45.590
We won't be needing your services anymore.

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.680
Don't come back.

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.430
But why?

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.590
Did I do something wrong?

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:06.980
Rei!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.110
Maya?

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:10.790
Rei!

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:17.100
She's like a little sister to me!

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.990
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.570
Eat as much as you want. I'm paying.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.250
So, Rei...

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:28.870
Do you think telling the story of <i>Snow White</i> without asking first was the problem?

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:30.990
No, Maya.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.570
The only problem with it,

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.720
if you can call it that,

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.270
is the strange passion your acting seems to hold. Your talent.

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:45.070
They envy and fear you... so they chase you away.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:51.150
Maya, this kind of thing is going to happen to you again and again.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.780
If you get depressed every time something bad happens to you,

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.680
life will soon become a dark place for you.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:58.960
Instead, try thinking of something you enjoy at times like this.

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.100
Something I enjoy?

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:04.000
Like acting. You like acting, don't you?

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.300
Rei.

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.040
No matter how much you enjoy it,

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:11.650
sometimes even acting becomes hard and you want to run away from it, right?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:17.600
But as long as you don't abandon acting, acting will never abandon you.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:21.040
Isn't that right, Maya?

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.670
That's right. That's exactly how it is.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.060
I have acting.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:30.090
And it will always be there for me!

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:56.420
You want me to play young Catherine in <i>Wuthering Heights</i>?

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:59.060
What do you think, Miss Kitajima?

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:02.420
Won't you join us for our audition tomorrow?

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:05.920
Hey, Maya! Say something!

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:08.820
Yes!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:09.500
I'll be there!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:13.080
Wuthering Heights

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:11.670
Please let me audition!

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:23.090
And now we will be auditioning for the part of young Catherine.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.500
Starting from the right, please state your name and your age.

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.150
Keiko Tanaka. Fourteen.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:30.570
Yuki Egawa. Sixteen.

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:33.060
Maya Kitajima. Fifteen!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:38.280
Now, please tell us how you would play Miss Catherine.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:44.280
Well, I'd certainly try hard to keep the spirit of the Catherine from the original novel.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.830
I'd focus on her intensity and her stubbornness.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:53.390
I'm really interested in Catherine's secret passion for Heathcliff.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:55.740
That's the area I would focus on in my portrayal.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:59.740
I'm next. Oh no, what should I do?

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.990
This story! This girl!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:06.420
And you, Miss Maya Kitajima?

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:12.940
I'm... I'm sorry! I'm not all that familiar with the story...

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.780
Hey, Majima!

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:24.300
This is Ryou Majima - he'll be playing the part of young Heathcliff.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.770
Nice to meet you all.

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:30.170
If I'm not mistaken, you used to be in the same acting troupe.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:31.760
That's right.

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.900
Feeling confident?

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:42.850
I'd really like to get this part if it means being on the same stage again!

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.440
I'm sure you'll do fine.

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.570
I can vouch for you.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:50.420
But you've got some stiff competition, huh?

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.330
I wouldn't worry about her too much.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:54.920
Yeah...

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:59.490
But I feel like I've seen her before somewhere.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:07.350
"Heathcliff... I'd wager your father is a King in the Eastern lands..."

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:13.380
"Your mother is an Indian princess and rich beyond compare."

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:17.600
"I'd wager that they're so wealthy they could buy Wuthering Heights...

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:20.090
and all the heaths that surround it!"

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:24.830
This is...

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:30.320
You're up!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.860
"I bet that's how it is..."

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.120
"Heathcliff!"

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:58.890
"And when you leave this place and find your own riches, be sure to return to me!"

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:08.630
"It would surprise Hindley no end!"

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.930
We're the ones who are surprised!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.420
How cheerful she's made Catherine!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:25.110
Now I remember! That girl...

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.880
is Ayumi Himekawa's main rival...

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.470
She's the stuff of legends.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:36.230
No, I must be mistaken.

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:39.610
So, I guess we'll be going with Yuki Egawa.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.990
She has the perfect aura for this role.

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:48.740
Keiko Tanaka is good too, but we definitely can't use that other girl, Maya Kitajima.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:52.130
This is...

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:56.630
I've failed miserably.

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:59.270
I couldn't put on Catherine's mask.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.130
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:05.460
We will now announce the role of Catherine.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.670
Maya Kitajima.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.230
Yes?

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:14.480
We've chosen you.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:17.610
M-Me?!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:19.220
Yes.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.170
Really?!

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.080
We're taking a huge gamble here.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.630
We're expecting you to bring the house down!

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.110
Yes, sir!

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:35.010
Excuse me, but can I ask why you chose her?

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:39.920
To put it simply: she has potential.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.230
Potential?

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:45.140
The potential to portray an entirely new Catherine!

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:49.090
We wanted to take the risk and unfurl the play in a direction we've never taken before!

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:51.040
That's why we chose her.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:58.000
To understand why people do what they do,

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:01.920
you must first consider the surroundings they grew up in.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.260
Yes.

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:06.750
What type of person is Catherine?

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:10.710
That's what you need to consider, Maya.

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:19.250
Miss Catherine believes that not being allowed to play with Heathcliff is the worst punishment you can give to her.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:25.010
For Heathcliff, it's being separated from her.

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:31.450
Passionate, obstinate, headstrong, wild...

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:35.090
I just can't make Catherine my own.

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:38.800
You! Go away!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:42.180
Kazu's such a crybaby.

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:44.680
And he's pushy.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:51.010
That hurt! Kazu, you jerk, what are you doing?!

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.550
I'm really sorry!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.970
Are you all right?

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.130
Your knee's hurt!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:09.130
Nobody's home.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.130
My parents are never at home...

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:16.750
It hurts! It hurts!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:19.140
You're a boy, aren't you? Suck it up!

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:25.130
Wow, you've got so many toy cars!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.550
My dad bought them for me for my birthday.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.510
Can I play with them for a bit?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.550
Okay! Take it.

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.950
It's really going!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.980
I'm going to play with the police car!

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:48.900
Thank you so much. I really appreciate it.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:50.420
It was nothing, really...

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:53.650
Hey, let's play with this one next!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:57.180
Kazuo! You need to let her leave.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:00.850
It's late and she has to go home.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:07.360
No! No! I don't want you to go!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.030
I'm really sorry about this...

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:14.340
We're both at work all day, so he's all alone in the afternoons...

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:18.220
No, I don't want you to go!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.270
Kazu...

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:27.980
He's cute, getting so attached to me.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:32.630
He's always alone.

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.900
That's it!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:42.380
Catherine's house, Wuthering Heights, is all alone on the moors.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:48.750
She has no friends and she's always lived alone with nothing but the wind for company.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.280
No, I don't want you to go!

00:19:54.380 --> 00:20:00.290
In the midst of her loneliness, the only person she can turn to is... Heathcliff!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.910
I can do it! I can become Cathy!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.510
I will!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:12.010
Catherine hasn't turned up yet.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.780
It's that Maya Kitajima girl...

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:22.100
Sorry to have kept you waiting!

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:25.190
"Why do you cling to that gipsy brat...

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:28.830
when you have your own bairns to feed and fend for?!"

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.910
"Now, now... I found him abandoned, lying half-dead in the road!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:34.360
I couldn't very well leave him there!"

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.340
Catherine!

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.710
You... You're really dirty, aren't you?

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:58.270
You may be dark, but when you're clean-skinned, you resemble the son of a nobleman!

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.480
Ryou... Ryou!

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:07.490
Are you okay?

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.670
Yes.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:11.250
What's the girl who's playing Catherine like?

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.470
Do you get along?

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:13.540
Yeah...

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:17.580
Well, I don't think that Maya Kitajima is anything to write home about.

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.900
She's ordinary. I don't see why anyone would pick her over me.

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:22.390
And her audition was appalling too...

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:23.530
Stop that!

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.110
Talking about her behind her back is horrible.

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:31.580
She's very serious about her acting and she's getting more and more into the role of Catherine each day!

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:37.310
Maya has swept in and won a role in <i>Wuthering Heights</i>.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:43.300
But Maya, who has just turned fifteen, can't even begin to imagine...

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:48.470
the many trials that will befall her on that stage!

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
Asa kara yoru made yoru kara asa made

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
From morning until night, from dusk till dawn,

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
Futari ai no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
you can feel the warmth of our love.

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
Shunkashuutou mo ippun ichibyou mo

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
All year round, every minute and every second,

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
Futari hada no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
you can feel the warmth of our skin.

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
Kono dokidoki wa makka ni moeru taiyou

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
This excitement is burning brightly like the sun,

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
Atsuku moete atsuku togashite

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
let us burn brightly, let us burn until we're hot

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
Koi wo shimashou!

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
and make love!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Sunao na mama dakiaou!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Let's hold and be true to each other!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
Isso mekimeki nekki! mekimeki daisuki!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
And let's add more heat! I love the heat!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Aishiae!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Feel the love!

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:26.330
Maya, I completely understand that you get lost in your performance...

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:31.020
but how can you look at Heathcliff like that?

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.260
I'm an actor as well, so I understand the need to immerse yourself in your role,

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:41.070
but you've never looked at me the way you're looking at that guy!

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:44.630
I know you're only acting,

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:48.710
but I don't know how you really feel anymore...

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 17 - Wuthering Heights
